#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default Cacti page help is located at docs.cacti.net.  However, if your system does not have access to the Internet, you may download the documentation locally in HTML format and host it in the 'docs' location of you Cacti server.  If you choose only to leverage the local location for page help documentation, check this checkbox."
msgstr "Site na ndabara, enyemaka ihu akwụkwọ Cacti dị na docs.cacti.net. Agbanyeghị, ọ bụrụ na sistemụ gị enweghị ohere ịntanetị, ị nwere ike ibudata akwụkwọ nduzi ahụ na kọmputa gị n'ụdị HTML ma debe ya n'ebe 'docs' nke sava Cacti gị. Ọ bụrụ na ị họrọ naanị iji ebe obodo maka akwụkwọ enyemaka ihu akwụkwọ, tụọ igbe nlele a akara."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Deletion Verification"
msgstr "Nkwenye Nhichapụ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Prompt user before item deletion."
msgstr "Jụọ onye ọrụ tupu ehichapụ ihe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Preservation Preset"
msgstr "Ntọala Nchekwa Isi Iyi Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will set Radio Button to Delete related Data Sources of a Graph when removing Graphs.  Note: Cacti will not allow the removal of Data Sources if they are used in other Graphs."
msgstr "Mgbe e gbanyere ya, Cacti ga-edobe Bọtịnụ Redio ka ọ Hichapụ Isi Iyi Data metụtara Eserese mgbe a na-ewepụ Eserese. Rịba ama: Cacti agaghị ekwe ka ewepụ Isi Iyi Data ma ọ bụrụ na e ji ha eme ihe na Eserese ndị ọzọ."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graphs Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Mmeghe Eserese n'Onwe Ya"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will not lock Graphs.  This allow a faster manual modification of Data Sources related to a Graph."
msgstr "Mgbe e gbanyere ya, Cacti agaghị akpọchi Eserese. Nke a na-enye ohere maka mgbanwe aka dị ngwa ngwa nke Isi Iyi Data metụtara Eserese."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hide Cacti Dashboard"
msgstr "Zoo Bọọdụ Njikwa Cacti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "For use with Cacti's External Link Support.  Using this setting, you can hide the Cacti Dashboard, so you can display just your own page."
msgstr "Maka iji na Nkwado Njikọ Mpụga nke Cacti. Site n'iji ntọala a, ị nwere ike izo Bọọdụ Njikwa Cacti, ka i wee nwee ike igosipụta naanị ihu akwụkwọ nke gị."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Drag-N-Drop"
msgstr "Gbanye Ịdọrọ-na-Tụda"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Some of Cacti's interfaces support Drag-N-Drop.  If checked this option will be enabled.  Note: For visually impaired user, this option may be disabled."
msgstr "Ụfọdụ ihu njikọ Cacti na-akwado Ịdọrọ-na-Tụda. Ọ bụrụ na a tụọ ya akara, a ga-agbanye nhọrọ a. Rịba ama: Maka onye ọrụ nwere nsogbu anya, enwere ike gbanyụọ nhọrọ a."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Site Security"
msgstr "Nchekwa Saịtị"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Connections over HTTPS"
msgstr "Manye Njikọ Site na HTTPS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, any attempts to access Cacti will be redirected to HTTPS to ensure high security."
msgstr "Mgbe a tụrụ ya akara, a ga-eduzi mbọ ọ bụla ịbanye na Cacti gaa na HTTPS iji hụ na e nwere nchekwa dị elu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Unsafe Remote Data Collector HTTPS"
msgstr "Kwe ka HTTPS Nchịkọta Data Dị Ebe Anya na-adịghị Nchebe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow the use of Self Signed Certificates and allow the hostname of the Certificate to differ from that of the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Kwe ka ojiji nke Asambodo Ejiri Aka Bịanye Aka ma kwe ka aha nnabata nke Asambodo dị iche na nke Nchịkọta Data Dị Ebe Anya."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Unsafe Metacharacters in Data Input Methods"
msgstr "Kwe ka Mkpụrụedemede Pụrụ Iche na-adịghị Nchebe n'Ụzọ Ntinye Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Historically, Cacti administrators created simple Data Input Methods that include commands like \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" to represent a numeric value for use in Cacti Graphs.  In earlier versions of Cacti, this was permitted.  However, this is an unsafe practice as it is a gateway for third party users to publish insecure Data Templates.  In modern Cacti, these types of practices should be avoided.  However, we provide this option if you have older Data Input Methods that contain these unsafe Meta Characters and have not converted them to local scripts in the 'scripts' directory.  When this option is unchecked, Cacti restricts shell-style metacharacters such as quotation marks, curly brackets, vertical bars, backslashes, and backticks.  Cacti continues to allow greater-than and less-than signs for things like <path_cacti> and for input parameters, but if this option is unchecked, that is the limit of their permitted use."
msgstr "N'akụkọ ihe mere eme, ndị nchịkwa Cacti mepụtara Ụzọ Ntinye Data dị mfe nke gụnyere iwu dịka \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" iji nọchite anya ọnụọgụ maka ojiji na Eserese Cacti. Na nsụgharị mbụ nke Cacti, ekwere nke a. Otú ọ dị, nke a bụ omume na-adịghị mma ebe ọ bụ ụzọ ndị ọrụ nke atọ si ebipụta Nlereanya Data na-enweghị nchebe. Na Cacti nke oge a, ekwesịrị izere ụdị omume ndị a. Otú ọ dị, anyị na-enye nhọrọ a ma ọ bụrụ na ị nwere Ụzọ Ntinye Data ochie nwere Mkpụrụedemede Pụrụ Iche ndị a na-adịghị mma ma ị gbanwebeghị ha ka ha bụrụ ederede mpaghara na ndekọ 'scripts'. Mgbe a na-ahọrọghị nhọrọ a, Cacti na-egbochi mkpụrụedemede dị ka shell dịka akara ngụ, mgbaaka gbagọrọ agbagọ, ogwe kwụ ọtọ, backslash, na backtick. Cacti na-aga n'ihu na-ekwe ka akara karịrị na obere karịa maka ihe dị ka <path_cacti> na maka paramita ntinye, mana ọ bụrụ na ahọrọghị nhọrọ a, nke ahụ bụ oke ojiji ha ekwere."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Script Policy"
msgstr "Amụma Ederede Nchebe Ọdịnaya"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls the script-src CSP policy.  In Nonce Modes, Cacti Plugins that use inline JavaScript must include the nonce attribute from Cacti's builtin function 'CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute()'. Otherwise, those scripts will be blocked by the browser.  Currently, Cacti only allows reporting on Cacti Plugins that do not properly use Nonce Mode.  In the future, we will allow Administrators to block such plugins from using their inline JavaScript if they are not using Nonces."
msgstr "Na-achịkwa amụma script-src CSP. Na Ọnọdụ Nonce, Ngwa Mgbakwunye Cacti na-eji JavaScript dị n'ahịrị ga-etinyerịrị àgwà nonce sitere na ọrụ etinyere n'ime Cacti 'CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute()'. Ma ọ bụghị ya, ihe nchọgharị ga-egbochi ederede ndị ahụ. Ugbu a, Cacti na-ekwe naanị ịkọ akụkọ maka Ngwa Mgbakwunye Cacti na-adịghị eji Ọnọdụ Nonce nke ọma. N'ọdịnihu, anyị ga-ekwe ka Ndị Nchịkwa gbochie ngwa mgbakwunye ndị dị otú ahụ iji JavaScript ha dị n'ahịrị ma ọ bụrụ na ha anaghị eji Nonces."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Kwe ka JavaScript Dị n'Ahịrị Na-enweghị Nonce"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow both unsafe-eval and Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Kwe ka ma unsafe-eval ma JavaScript Dị n'Ahịrị Na-enweghị Nonce"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Mode - Reporting Only"
msgstr "Ọnọdụ Nonce - Mkpesa Naanị"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "CSP Violation Report URI"
msgstr "URI Mkpesa Mmegide CSP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use <url_path>/csp_report.php. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL ebe ihe nchọgharị na-ezipụ akụkọ mmebi CSP na ọnọdụ nonce-report na nonce. Hapụ ya ka ọ tọgbọ chakoo iji jiri <url_path>/csp_report.php. Ga-enwerịrị naanị mkpụrụedemede URL dị mma."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Alternate Sources"
msgstr "Isi Iyi Ndị Ọzọ nke Content-Security"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Space delimited domain names that will be permitted to be accessed outside of the Web Server itself.  This is important for users choosing to use a CDN, or hosting site.  Sources can includes wildcards for example: *.mydomain.com, or a protocol, for example: https://*.example.com.  These Alternate Sources include Image, CSS and JavaScript types only."
msgstr "Aha ngalaba (domain) ndị oghere kewara nke a ga-ekwe ka e nweta site n'èzí sava weebụ n'onwe ya.  Nke a dị mkpa maka ndị ọrụ na-ahọrọ iji CDN, ma ọ bụ saịtị nnabata.  Isi mmalite nwere ike ịgụnye wildcards dịka ọmụmaatụ: *.mydomain.com, ma ọ bụ protocol, dịka ọmụmaatụ: https://*.example.com.  Isi mmalite ndị ọzọ a gụnyere naanị ụdị Onyonyo, CSS na JavaScript."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use /cacti/csp_report.php at the installation root. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL ebe ihe nchọgharị weebụ na-eziga (POST) akụkọ mmebi CSP na ọnọdụ nonce-report na nonce. Hapụ ya n'efu ka e jiri /cacti/csp_report.php na mgbọrọgwụ nrụnye. Ga-enwerịrị naanị mkpụrụedemede URL dị mma."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Graph Creation"
msgstr "Gbanye Mmepụta Eserese Akpaaka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Graph.  This is useful when adjusting Device settings so as to avoid creating new Graphs each time you save an object.  Invoking Automation Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Mgbe agbanyụrụ ya, Cacti Akpaaka agaghị emepụta Eserese ọ bụla n'onwe ya. Nke a bara uru mgbe ị na-edozi ntọala Ngwaọrụ iji zere imepụta Eserese ọhụrụ oge ọ bụla i chekwara ihe. Ịkpọ Iwu Akpaaka n'aka ka ga-ekwe omume."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Tree Item Creation"
msgstr "Gbanye Mmepụta Ihe Osisi Akpaaka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Tree Item.  This is useful when adjusting Device or Graph settings so as to avoid creating new Tree Entries each time you save an object.  Invoking Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Mgbe agbanyụrụ ya, Cacti Akpaaka agaghị emepụta Ihe Osisi ọ bụla n'onwe ya. Nke a bara uru mgbe ị na-edozi ntọala Ngwaọrụ ma ọ bụ Eserese iji zere imepụta Ntinye Osisi ọhụrụ oge ọ bụla i chekwara ihe. Ịkpọ Iwu n'aka ka ga-ekwe omume."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification To Email"
msgstr "Email Ebe A Na-ezipụ Ọkwa Akpaaka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to send Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the Primary Cacti Admins Email account."
msgstr "Adreesị Email a ga-ezigara Email Ọkwa Akpaaka ma ọ bụrụ na akọwaghị ya n'ọkwa Netwọk Akpaaka. Ọ bụrụ na ahapụrụ oghere a, ma ọ bụ uru Netwọk Akpaaka n'efu, Cacti ga-eji akaụntụ Email Ndị Nchịkwa Isi nke Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Name"
msgstr "Aha Onye Nzipụ Ọkwa Akpaaka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Name to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Name."
msgstr "Aha Email a ga-eji maka Email Ọkwa Akpaaka ma ọ bụrụ na akọwaghị ya n'ọkwa Netwọk Akpaaka. Ọ bụrụ na ahapụrụ oghere a, ma ọ bụ uru Netwọk Akpaaka n'efu, Cacti ga-eji Aha Onye Nzipụ ndabere nke sistemụ."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Email"
msgstr "Email Onye Nzipụ Ọkwa Akpaaka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Email Address."
msgstr "Adreesị Ozi-e a ga-eji maka Ozi-e Ọkwa Automation ma ọ bụrụ na akọwaghị ya na ọkwa Netwọk Automation.  Ọ bụrụ na ahapụrụ ubi a, ma ọ bụ uru Netwọk Automation ka ọ tọgbọ chakoo, Cacti ga-eji Adreesị Ozi-e Site na nke ndabara sistemụ."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Template Defaults"
msgstr "Ndabara Templeeti Eserese"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Template Test Data Source"
msgstr "Nnwale Isi Ndata Templeeti Eserese"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Check this checkbox if you wish to test the Data Sources prior to their creation for new and newly imported Graph Templates.  With Test Data Sources enabled, if the Data Source does not return valid data, the Graph will not be created.  This setting is important if you wish to have a more generic Device Template that can include more Graph Templates that can be selectively applied depending on the characteristics of the Device itself.  Note: If you have a long running script as a Data Source, the time to create Graphs will be increased."
msgstr "Kaa igbe nhọrọ a ma ọ bụrụ na ịchọrọ ịnwale Isi Ndata tupu e kee ha maka Templeeti Eserese ọhụrụ na ndị e bubatara ọhụrụ.  Mgbe agbanyere Nnwale Isi Ndata, ọ bụrụ na Isi Ndata eweghachighị ndata ziri ezi, a gaghị eke Eserese ahụ.  Ntọala a dị mkpa ma ọ bụrụ na ịchọrọ inwe Templeeti Ngwaọrụ sara mbara karị nke nwere ike ịgụnye Templeeti Eserese ndị ọzọ a ga-etinye n'ọrụ dịka njirimara nke Ngwaọrụ ahụ n'onwe ya si dị.  Rịba ama: Ọ bụrụ na ị nwere skripụtụ na-ewe ogologo oge dịka Isi Ndata, oge eji eke Eserese ga-abawanye."

