#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent Timeout"
msgstr "Nkwụsị Oge Onye Nnọchiteanya Dịpụrụ Adịpụ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The amount of time, in seconds, that the Central Cacti web server will wait for a response from the Remote Data Collector to obtain various Device information before abandoning the request.  On Devices that are associated with Data Collectors other than the Central Cacti Data Collector, the Remote Agent must be used to gather Device information."
msgstr "Oge, na sekọnd, nke sava webụ Etiti Cacti ga-echere azịza site n'aka Onye Na-anakọta Data Dị N'ebe Dị Anya iji nweta ozi Ngwaọrụ dị iche iche tupu ọ hapụ arịrịọ ahụ. Na Ngwaọrụ ndị jikọtara na Ndị Na-anakọta Data ndị ọzọ na-abụghị Onye Na-anakọta Data Etiti Cacti, a ga-ejiriri Onye Nnọchiteanya Dị N'ebe Dị Anya chịkọta ozi Ngwaọrụ."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Refresh Poller Table Per Cycle"
msgstr "Melite Tebụl Poller N'okirikiri Ọ Bụla"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This setting is for a single poller systems only to rebuild the poller output table on each polling cycle to prevent the memory table from swapping on very large systems with large databases that could use swap."
msgstr "Ntọala a bụ maka sistemụ nwere naanị otu poller iji wughachi tebụl mpụta poller n'okirikiri nchịkọta ọ bụla iji gbochie tebụl ebe nchekwa ịgbanwe gaa na swap na nnukwu sistemụ nwere nnukwu nchekwa data nwere ike iji swap."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Resource Cache Replication"
msgstr "Gbanyụọ Mkpụgharị Ebe Nchekwa Akụrụngwa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, the main Cacti Data Collector will cache the entire web site and plugins into a Resource Cache.  Then, periodically the Remote Data Collectors will update themselves with any updates from the main Cacti Data Collector.  This Resource Cache essentially allows Remote Data Collectors to self upgrade.  If you do not wish to use this option, you can disable it using this setting."
msgstr "Nke ndabara, isi Onye Nchịkọta Data Cacti ga-echekwa weebụsaịtị dum na ngwa mgbakwunye n'ime Nchekwa Akụrụngwa. Mgbe ahụ, site n'oge ruo n'oge, Ndị Nchịkọta Data Dị N'ebe Dị Anya ga-emelitere onwe ha site na mmelite ọ bụla sitere n'isi Onye Nchịkọta Data Cacti. Nchekwa Akụrụngwa a na-enyere Ndị Nchịkọta Data Dị N'ebe Dị Anya aka ịkwalite onwe ha. Ọ bụrụ na ị chọghị iji nhọrọ a, ị nwere ike gbanyụọ ya site na ntọala a."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Behavior"
msgstr "Omume SNMP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Agent Support Enabled"
msgstr "Agbanyere Nkwado SNMP Agent"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this option is checked, Cacti will populate SNMP Agent tables with Cacti device and system information.  It does not enable the SNMP Agent itself."
msgstr "Ọ bụrụ na akaa nhọrọ a, Cacti ga-ejupụta tebụl SNMP Agent na ozi ngwaọrụ na sistemụ Cacti.  Ọ naghị agbanye SNMP Agent n'onwe ya."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable MD5 and DES for SNMPv3"
msgstr "Gbanye MD5 na DES maka SNMPv3"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The MD5 authentication and DES privacy algorithms are legacy, weak, and unavailable on hardened (FIPS) PHP and Net-SNMP builds.  When disabled, MD5 and DES are removed from the SNMPv3 Authentication and Privacy Protocol dropdowns shown when editing a Device and in the Automation SNMP Options, leaving only the stronger SHA and AES algorithms."
msgstr "Algọridim nkwenye MD5 na nke nzuzo DES bụ ndị ochie, adịghị ike, ma adịghị na nrụnye PHP na Net-SNMP e wusiri ike (FIPS).  Mgbe agbanyụrụ ya, a na-ewepụ MD5 na DES na ndepụta Usoro Nkwenye na Nzuzo SNMPv3 nke na-egosi mgbe a na-edezi Ngwaọrụ nakwa na Nhọrọ SNMP Automation, na-ahapụ naanị algọridim SHA na AES siri ike karị."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Credential Cache"
msgstr "Gbanye Ebe Nchekwa Nzuzo (Credential Cache)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Pre-harden and cache SNMPv3 credential arguments once per credential change so each poller process reuses them instead of rebuilding them on every request.  This yields a marginal savings when collecting with SNMPv3 credentials through the Net-SNMP binaries.  The php-snmp extension handles most SNMPv3 gets in-process and bypasses this cache, but the Net-SNMP binaries (and therefore this cache) are still used for SNMP walks, hex output, requests that set a context or engine id, and protocol combinations that the running PHP version does not support.  Enable this if you collect any of those workloads with SNMPv3 credentials."
msgstr "Kwadoo ma chekwaa arụmụka nzuzo SNMPv3 otu ugboro maka mgbanwe nzuzo ọ bụla ka usoro poller ọ bụla nwee ike iji ha mee ihe ọzọ kama ịrụgharị ha na arịrịọ ọ bụla.  Nke a na-eweta obere nchekwa mgbe a na-anakọta na nzuzo SNMPv3 site na faịlụ Net-SNMP.  Mgbatị php-snmp na-ahụ maka ọtụtụ SNMPv3 gets n'ime usoro ma na-agafe ebe nchekwa a, mana a ka na-eji faịlụ Net-SNMP (ya na ebe nchekwa a) maka SNMP walks, mpụta hex, arịrịọ na-esetịpụ context ma ọ bụ engine id, na njikọta usoro nke ụdị PHP na-agba ọsọ anaghị akwado.  Gbanye nke a ma ọ bụrụ na ị na-anakọta nke ọ bụla n'ime ọrụ ndị ahụ na nzuzo SNMPv3."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Get OID Limit"
msgstr "Oke OID SNMP Get"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default maximum number of SNMP Get OIDs to issue per snmpget request.  For Devices, this setting is controlled at the Device level.  You should only use this setting when using Cacti's SNMP API natively in your scripts or plugins."
msgstr "Ọnụọgụgụ kachasị ndabara nke SNMP Get OIDs a ga-ewepụta maka arịrịọ snmpget ọ bụla.  Maka Ngwaọrụ, a na-achịkwa ntọala a na ọkwa Ngwaọrụ.  I kwesịrị iji ntọala a naanị mgbe ị na-eji SNMP API nke Cacti n'onwe ya na skripụtụ ma ọ bụ plọgịn gị."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Bulkwalk Fetch Size"
msgstr "Oke Nbudata SNMP Bulkwalk"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How many OID's should be returned per snmpbulkwalk request?  For Devices with large SNMP trees, increasing this size will increase re-index performance over a WAN."
msgstr "OID ole ka e kwesịrị iweghachi n'otu arịrịọ snmpbulkwalk?  Maka Ngwaọrụ nwere osisi SNMP buru ibu, ịbawanye nha a ga-eme ka arụmọrụ nhazigharị ndepụta dịkwuo mma n'elu WAN."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable increasing OID Check"
msgstr "Gbanyụọ Nlele OID Na-abawanye"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls disabling check for increasing OID while walking OID tree."
msgstr "Na-achịkwa igbanyụ nlele maka OID na-abawanye mgbe a na-agafe osisi OID."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Additional Data Collector Settings"
msgstr "Ntọala Ndị Ọzọ nke Onye Nchịkọta Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Invalid Data Logging"
msgstr "Ndekọ Data Na-ezighị Ezi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How would you like the Data Collector output errors logged?  Options include: 'Detailed' which details every error, 'Summary' which provides the number of output errors per Device, and 'None', which does not provide error counts."
msgstr "Kedu otu ị ga-achọ ka e dee ndekọ mperi mmepụta nke Onye Nchịkọta Data? Nhọrọ gụnyere: 'Nkọwa Zuru Ezu' nke na-akọwapụta mperi ọ bụla, 'Nchịkọta' nke na-enye ọnụọgụ mperi mmepụta maka Ngwaọrụ ọ bụla, yana 'Ọ dịghị', nke na-adịghị enye ọnụọgụ mperi."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Nchịkọta"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Detailed"
msgstr "Nkọwa Zuru Ezu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of PHP Script Servers"
msgstr "Ọnụọgụ Sava Skriptị PHP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent script server processes to run per spine process.  Settings between 1 and 15 are accepted.  This parameter will help if you are running several threads and script server scripts and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Ọnụọgụ usoro sava skriptị na-agba n'otu oge maka usoro spine ọ bụla. A na-anabata ntọala dị n'etiti 1 na 15. Ntọala a ga-enyere aka ma ọ bụrụ na ị na-agba ọtụtụ eriri na skriptị sava skriptị ma ọ bara uru naanị maka Onye Nchịkọta Data spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Script and Script Server Timeout Value"
msgstr "Uru Oge Nkwụsị nke Skriptị na Sava Skriptị"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum time that spine will wait on a script to complete.  This timeout value is in seconds and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Oge kachasị nke spine ga-eche ka edemede (script) rụchaa ọrụ.  Uru njedebe oge a dị na sekọnd ma dị irè naanị maka Onye Nchịkọta Data nke spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Periodic All Device Re-Index"
msgstr "Ntinyegharị Ndepụta Ngwaọrụ Niile Oge Ụfọdụ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Re-Index All Device Schedule"
msgstr "Nhazi Oge Ntinyegharị Ndepụta Ngwaọrụ Niile"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "At what frequency do you wish to Re-Index all Devices.  This Re-Index will occur at midnight at the frequency that you select."
msgstr "Ugboro ole ka ị chọrọ itinyegharị ndepụta Ngwaọrụ niile. Ntinyegharị ndepụta a ga-eme n'etiti abalị n'ugboro nke ị họọrọ."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Weekly on Sunday"
msgstr "Kwa Izu na Sọnde"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Monthly on Sunady"
msgstr "Kwa ọnwa n'ụbọchị Ụka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Background Timeout and Concurrent Process Settings"
msgstr "Ntọala Njedebe Oge N'azụ na Usoro Na-arụkọ Ọrụ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Report Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Njedebe Oge Mmepụta Akụkọ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Reports Generation script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Oge kachasị nke edemede Mmepụta Akụkọ Cacti nwere ike ịgba ọsọ n'emepụtaghị njehie njedebe oge na n'egbughị ya."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Minute"
msgstr "Nkeji %s"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Statistics Timeout"
msgstr "Oge Nkwụsị nke Ọnụọgụ Isi Iyi Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Data Source Statistics script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Oge kachasị skriptị Ọnụọgụ Isi Iyi Data nke Cacti nwere ike ịgba n'emepụtaghị mperi oge nkwụsị na n'akwụsịghị ya."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDChecker Timeout"
msgstr "Oge Nkwụsị nke RRDChecker"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's RRDfile check script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Oge kachasị nke edemede nlele RRDfile nke Cacti nwere ike ịgba ọsọ n'emepụtaghị njehie njedebe oge na n'egbughị ya."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Hour"
msgstr "Awa %s"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Commands Timeout"
msgstr "Oge Nkwụsị nke Iwu Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Background Commands script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed.  This script will perform tasks such as re-indexing Devices and pruning devices from Remote Data Collectors."
msgstr "Oge kachasị skriptị Iwu Ndabere nke Cacti nwere ike ịgba n'emepụtaghị mperi oge nkwụsị na n'akwụsịghị ya. Skriptị a ga-arụ ọrụ dịka itinyegharị ndepụta Ngwaọrụ na ikpochapụ ngwaọrụ site na Ndị Nchịkọta Data Dị N'ebe Dị Anya."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Command Concurrent Processes"
msgstr "Usoro Iwu Poller Na-agba N'otu Oge"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent Poller Command processes.  The will be at most one concurrent command per host within the Poller Command pool."
msgstr "Ọnụọgụ usoro Iwu Poller na-agba n'otu oge. A ga-enwe iwu na-agba n'otu oge nke kachasị otu maka host ọ bụla n'ime nchịkọta Iwu Poller."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Process"
msgstr "Usoro 1"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Processes"
msgstr "Usoro %d"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Oge Nkwụsị nke Mmepụta Ndabere Ndozi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time a Cacti's Maintenance script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Oge kachasị skriptị Ndozi nke Cacti nwere ike ịgba n'emepụtaghị mperi oge nkwụsị na n'akwụsịghị ya."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spikekill Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Oge Nkwụsị nke Mmepụta Ndabere Spikekill"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time a Cacti's Spikekill script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Oge kachasị skriptị Spikekill nke Cacti nwere ike ịgba n'emepụtaghị mperi oge nkwụsị na n'akwụsịghị ya."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Defaults"
msgstr "Ntọala Ndabere Onye Nchịkọta Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "These settings are maintained at the Data Collector level.  The values here are only defaults used when first creating a Data Collector."
msgstr "A na-edobe ntọala ndị a n'ọkwa Onye Nchịkọta Data.  Uru ndị dị ebe a bụ naanị ntọala ndabere a na-eji mgbe a na-emepụta Onye Nchịkọta Data na mbụ."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Processes"
msgstr "Usoro Onye Nchịkọta Data"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of concurrent processes to execute per Data Collector.  NOTE: Starting from Cacti 1.2, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector.  Moving forward, this value is only a preset for the Data Collector.  Using a higher number when using cmd.php will improve performance.  Performance improvements in Spine are best resolved with the threads parameter.  When using Spine, we recommend a lower number and leveraging threads instead.  When using cmd.php, use no more than 2x the number of CPU cores."
msgstr "Ọnụọgụgụ ndabere nke usoro na-arụkọ ọrụ nke a ga-eme maka Onye Nchịkọta Data ọ bụla.  RỊBA AMA: Malite na Cacti 1.2, a na-edobe ntọala a n'ime Onye Nchịkọta Data.  Site ugbu a gaa n'ihu, uru a bụ naanị ntọala tupu oge maka Onye Nchịkọta Data.  Iji ọnụọgụgụ dị elu mgbe ị na-eji cmd.php ga-eme ka arụmọrụ ka mma.  Ọ ka mma idozi mmụba arụmọrụ na Spine site na paramita threads.  Mgbe ị na-eji Spine, anyị na-atụ aro ọnụọgụgụ dị ala ma jiri threads kama.  Mgbe ị na-eji cmd.php, ejikwala ihe karịrị 2x ọnụọgụgụ nke CPU cores."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Threads per Process"
msgstr "Threads maka Usoro Ọ bụla"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Default Threads allowed per process.  NOTE: Starting in Cacti 1.2+, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector, and this is simply the Preset.  Using a higher number when using Spine will improve performance.  However, ensure that you have enough MySQL/MariaDB connections to support the following equation: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers).  You must also ensure that you have enough spare connections for user login connections as well."
msgstr "Threads Ndabere a kwadoro maka usoro ọ bụla.  RỊBA AMA: Malite na Cacti 1.2+, a na-edobe ntọala a n'ime Onye Nchịkọta Data, nke a bụkwa naanị Ntọala Tupu Oge.  Iji ọnụọgụgụ dị elu mgbe ị na-eji Spine ga-eme ka arụmọrụ ka mma.  Otú ọ dị, jide n'aka na ị nwere njikọ MySQL/MariaDB zuru oke iji kwado nha nhata a: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers).  Ị ga-ejidekwa n'aka na ị nwere njikọ ndabere zuru oke maka njikọ nbanye ndị ọrụ kwa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Authentication Method"
msgstr "Ụzọ Nkwenye Njirimara"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "<blockquote><i>Built-in Authentication</i> - Cacti handles user authentication, which allows you to create users and give them rights to different areas within Cacti.<br><br><i>Web Basic Authentication</i> - Authentication is handled by the web server. Users can be added or created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.<br><br><i>LDAP Authentication</i> - Allows for authentication against a LDAP server. Users will be created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.  If PHPs LDAP module is not enabled, LDAP Authentication will not appear as a selectable option.<br><br><i>Multiple LDAP/AD Domain Authentication</i> - Allows administrators to support multiple disparate groups from different LDAP/AD directories to access Cacti resources.  Just as LDAP Authentication, the PHP LDAP module is required to utilize this method.</blockquote>"
msgstr "<blockquote><i>Nkwenye Njirimara E Wubere n'Ime</i> - Cacti na-ahụ maka nkwenye njirimara onye ọrụ, nke na-enye gị ohere ịmepụta ndị ọrụ ma nye ha ikike na mpaghara dị iche iche n'ime Cacti.<br><br><i>Nkwenye Njirimara Web Basic</i> - Sọva weebụ na-ahụ maka nkwenye njirimara. Enwere ike ịgbakwunye ma ọ bụ mepụta ndị ọrụ na-akpaghị aka na mbanye mbụ ma ọ bụrụ na akọwapụtala Onye Ọrụ Nlereanya, ma ọ bụghị ya, a ga-eji ikike ọbịa akọwapụtara mee ihe.<br><br><i>Nkwenye Njirimara LDAP</i> - Na-enye ohere nkwenye njirimara na sọva LDAP. A ga-emepụta ndị ọrụ na-akpaghị aka na mbanye mbụ ma ọ bụrụ na akọwapụtala Onye Ọrụ Nlereanya, ma ọ bụghị ya, a ga-eji ikike ọbịa akọwapụtara mee ihe. Ọ bụrụ na agbanyeghị modul LDAP nke PHP, Nkwenye Njirimara LDAP agaghị apụta dị ka nhọrọ a ga-ahọpụta.<br><br><i>Nkwenye Njirimara Ọtụtụ Ngalaba LDAP/AD</i> - Na-enye ndị nchịkwa ohere ịkwado ọtụtụ otu dị iche iche sitere na ndekọ LDAP/AD dị iche iche iji nweta akụrụngwa Cacti. Dị ka Nkwenye Njirimara LDAP, a chọrọ modul LDAP nke PHP iji jiri usoro a mee ihe.</blockquote>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Support Authentication Cookies"
msgstr "Kwado Kuki Nkwenye Njirimara"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If a user authenticates and selects 'Keep me signed in', an authentication cookie will be created on the user's computer allowing that user to stay logged in.  The authentication cookie expires after 90 days of non-use."
msgstr "Ọ bụrụ na onye ọrụ enyochaa njirimara ma họrọ 'Debe m na nbanye', a ga-emepụta kuki nyocha njirimara na kọmputa onye ọrụ ahụ nke ga-enyere onye ọrụ ahụ aka ịnọgide na nbanye.  Kuki nyocha njirimara ahụ na-agwụ mgbe ụbọchị 90 gachara n'ejighị ya."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Special Users"
msgstr "Ndị Ọrụ Pụrụ Iche"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Primary Admin"
msgstr "Onye Nchịkwa Isi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the primary administrative account that will automatically receive Emails when the Cacti system experiences issues.  To receive these Emails, ensure that your mail settings are correct, and the administrative account has an Email address that is set."
msgstr "Aha akaụntụ nchịkwa isi nke ga-enweta ozi-e na-akpaghị aka mgbe sistemụ Cacti nwere nsogbu. Iji nweta ozi-e ndị a, hụ na ntọala ozi gị ziri ezi, na akaụntụ nchịkwa ahụ nwere adreesị ozi-e edobere."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "No User"
msgstr "Enweghị Onye Ọrụ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Guest User"
msgstr "Onye Ọrụ Ọbịa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the guest user for viewing graphs; is 'No User' by default."
msgstr "Aha onye ọrụ ọbịa maka ilele eserese; bụ 'Enweghị Onye Ọrụ' na ndabara."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "User Template"
msgstr "Nlereanya Onye Ọrụ"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the user that Cacti will use as a template for new Web Basic and LDAP users; is 'guest' by default.  This user account will be disabled from logging in upon being selected."
msgstr "Aha onye ọrụ nke Cacti ga-eji dị ka nlereanya maka ndị ọrụ Web Basic na LDAP ọhụrụ; bụ 'guest' na ndabara. A ga-egbochi akaụntụ onye ọrụ a ịbanye mgbe a họpụtara ya."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Authentication Settings"
msgstr "Ntọala Nkwenye Njirimara Basic"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Auth Login Failure Message"
msgstr "Ozi Ọdịda Nbanye Nkwenye Njirimara Basic"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if there are issues mapping the username to a valid Cacti account, the message included here will be displayed to users.  It can include both text and HTML."
