#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Auth Mapfile"
msgstr "Faịlụ Map Nkwenye Njirimara Basic"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if the basic account needs to be translated to a different login account, you can specify a CSV file here to map the basic account to the desired login account."
msgstr "Mgbe ị na-eji nkwenye njirimara basic, ọ bụrụ na ọ dị mkpa ịtụgharị akaụntụ basic gaa na akaụntụ nbanye dị iche, ị nwere ike ịkọwapụta faịlụ CSV ebe a iji kọwaa akaụntụ basic gaa na akaụntụ nbanye achọrọ."

