msgstr "Nzacha nchọta a ga-eji chọta onye ọrụ na ndekọ LDAP, dịka maka Windows: <i>'(&amp;(objectclass=user)(objectcategory=user)(userPrincipalName=&lt;username&gt;*))'</i> maọbụ maka OpenLDAP: <i>'(&(objectClass=account)(uid=&lt;username&gt))'</i>.  A na-eji aha njirimara e nyere n'ebe mbanye dochie '&lt;username&gt'. "

