msgstr "Ọnụọgụgụ usoro ọrụ Boost na-arụkọ ọrụ n'otu oge a ga-eji hazie RRD niile dị na tebụl Boost."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Records"
msgstr "Ndekọ Kachasị"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost output table exceeds this size, in records, an update will take place."
msgstr "Ọ bụrụ na tebụl mmepụta Boost gafee nha a, na ndekọ, mmelite ga-eme."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Target Archive Rows Per Range"
msgstr "Ahịrị Ebe Nchekwa Ebumnuche N'otu Oke"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Boost updater assigns complete Local Data IDs to contiguous ranges near this row count. A single Local Data ID is never split, so a range can exceed the target. Lower this value to reduce updater memory and query time. The default value is 50000."
msgstr "Onye mmelite Boost na-ekenye Local Data IDs zuru ezu n'oke dị nso n'ọnụọgụ ahịrị a. A naghị ekewa otu Local Data ID, yabụ oke nwere ike gafee ebumnuche. Belata uru a iji belata ebe nchekwa onye mmelite na oge ajụjụ. Uru ndabara bụ 50000."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Argument Length"
msgstr "Ogologo Arụmụka Kachasị"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When boost sends update commands to RRDtool, it must not exceed the operating systems Maximum Argument Length.  This varies by operating system and kernel level.  For example: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ unlimited"
msgstr "Mgbe Boost na-eziga iwu mmelite na RRDtool, ọ gaghị agafe Ogologo Arụmụka Kachasị nke sistemụ arụmọrụ. Nke a na-adị iche site na sistemụ arụmọrụ na ọkwa kernel. Dịka ọmụmaatụ: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ enweghị oke"

