#: index.php
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> You are logged into a Remote Data Collector.  When <b>'online'</b>, you will be able to view and control much of the Main Cacti Web Site just as if you were logged into it.  Also, it's important to note that Remote Data Collectors are required to use the Cacti's Performance Boosting Services <b>'On Demand Updating'</b> feature, and we always recommend using Spine.  When the Remote Data Collector is <b>'offline'</b>, the Remote Data Collectors Web Site will contain much less information.  However, it will cache all updates until the Main Cacti Database and Web Server are reachable.  Then it will dump it's Boost table output back to the Main Cacti Database for updating."
msgstr "<strong>RỊBA AMA:</strong> Ị banyela n'ime Onye Nchịkọta Data Dị N'ebe Dị Anya. Mgbe ọ <b>'nọ na njikọ'</b>, ị ga-enwe ike ile na ijikwa ọtụtụ akụkụ nke Isi Weebụsaịtị Cacti dịka à ga-asị na ị banyere n'ime ya. Ọzọkwa, ọ dị mkpa ịrịba ama na a chọrọ Ndị Nchịkọta Data Dị N'ebe Dị Anya ka ha jiri atụmatụ <b>'Mmelite Mgbe Achọrọ'</b> nke Ọrụ Mbuli Ọrụ Cacti, anyị na-akwado iji Spine mgbe niile. Mgbe Onye Nchịkọta Data Dị N'ebe Dị Anya <b>'anọghị na njikọ'</b>, Weebụsaịtị Ndị Nchịkọta Data Dị N'ebe Dị Anya ga-enwe obere ozi karịa. Otú ọ dị, ọ ga-echekwa mmelite niile ruo mgbe enwere ike iru Isi Ebe Nchekwa Data Cacti na Sava Weebụ. Mgbe ahụ, ọ ga-ebughachi mmepụta tebụl Boost ya na Isi Ebe Nchekwa Data Cacti maka mmelite."

#: index.php
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> None of the Core Cacti Plugins, to date, have been re-designed to work with Remote Data Collectors.  Therefore, Plugins such as MacTrack, and HMIB, which require direct access to devices will not work with Remote Data Collectors at this time.  However, plugins such as Thold will work so long as the Remote Data Collector is in <b>'online'</b> mode."
msgstr "<strong>RỊBA AMA:</strong> Ọ dịghị nke ọ bụla n'ime Nkwụnye Isi Cacti, ruo taa, emezigharịrị ka ọ rụọ ọrụ na Ndị Nchịkọta Data Dị N'ebe Dị Anya. Ya mere, Nkwụnye dịka MacTrack, na HMIB, ndị chọrọ ịbanye na ngwaọrụ ozugbo agaghị arụ ọrụ na Ndị Nchịkọta Data Dị N'ebe Dị Anya n'oge a. Otú ọ dị, nkwụnye dịka Thold ga-arụ ọrụ ma ọ bụrụhaala na Onye Nchịkọta Data Dị N'ebe Dị Anya nọ n'ọnọdụ <b>'nọ na njikọ'</b>."

