msgid "Start time for [first|next] mail to take place. All future mailing times will be based upon this start time. A good example would be 2:00am. The time must be in the future.  If a fractional time is used, say 2:00am, it is assumed to be in the future."
msgstr "Oge mmalite maka ozi [mbụ|na-esote] ka o mee. Oge izipu ozi niile n'ọdịnihu ga-adabere n'oge mmalite a. Ezigbo ọmụmaatụ ga-abụ elekere 2:00 nke ụtụtụ. Oge ahụ ga-abụrịrị n'ọdịnihu.  Ọ bụrụ na ejiri oge nwere nkeji, dịka elekere 2:00 nke ụtụtụ, a na-ewere na ọ dị n'ọdịnihu."

