#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cacti requires several PHP Modules to be installed to work properly. If any of these are not installed, you will be unable to continue the installation until corrected. In addition, for optimal system performance Cacti should be run with certain MySQL system variables set.  Please follow the MySQL recommendations at your discretion.  Always seek the MySQL documentation if you have any questions."
msgstr "Cacti chọrọ ka etinye ọtụtụ Mọdụl PHP iji rụọ ọrụ nke ọma. Ọ bụrụ na etinyeghị nke ọ bụla n'ime ndị a, ị gaghị enwe ike ịga n'ihu na ntinye ahụ ruo mgbe edoziri ya. Na mgbakwunye, maka arụmọrụ sistemụ kachasị mma, ekwesịrị ịgba Cacti na mgbanwe sistemụ MySQL ụfọdụ edobere.  Biko soro ndụmọdụ MySQL dị ka uche gị si dị.  Chọọ akwụkwọ ntụziaka MySQL mgbe niile ma ọ bụrụ na ị nwere ajụjụ ọ bụla."

