#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your config.php file must be writable by the web server during install in order to configure the Remote poller.  Once installation is complete, you must set this file to Read Only to prevent possible security issues."
msgstr "Sava weebụ ga-enwerịrị ike ide ihe na faịlụ config.php gị n'oge ntinye iji hazie Remote poller.  Ozugbo ntinye gwụchara, ị ga-edoberịrị faịlụ a ka ọ bụrụ Naanị Ọgụgụ iji gbochie nsogbu nchekwa nwere ike ịdapụta."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Configuration of Poller"
msgstr "Nhazi nke Poller"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Remote Cacti Poller information has not been included in your config.php file.  Please review the config.php.dist, and set the variables: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, etc.  These variables must be set and point back to your Primary Cacti database server.  Correct this and try again."
msgstr "Etinyeghị ozi Remote Cacti Poller gị na faịlụ config.php gị.  Biko nyochaa config.php.dist, ma dozie mgbanwe ndị a: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, wdg.  Ekwesịrị idobe mgbanwe ndị a ma tụọ aka azụ na sava nchekwa data Cacti Isi gị.  Dozie nke a ma nwaa ọzọ."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Remote Poller Variables"
msgstr "Mgbanwe Remote Poller"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The variables that must be set in the config.php file include the following:"
msgstr "Mgbanwe ndị a ga-edoberịrị na faịlụ config.php gụnyere ndị a:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The Installer automatically assigns a $poller_id and adds it to the config.php file."
msgstr "Ihe Ntinye na-ekenye $poller_id na akpaghị aka ma tinye ya na faịlụ config.php."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Once the variables are all set in the config.php file, you must also grant the $rdatabase_username access to the main Cacti database server.  Follow the same procedure you would with any other Cacti install.  You may then press the 'Test Connection' button.  If the test is successful you will be able to proceed and complete the install."
msgstr "Ozugbo e tinyere mgbanwe niile na faịlụ config.php, ị ga-enyekwa $rdatabase_username ikike ịbanye na sava isi nchekwa data Cacti. Soro otu usoro ahụ ị ga-eso na nrụnye Cacti ọ bụla ọzọ. I nwere ike pịa bọtịnụ 'Nwalee Njikọ'. Ọ bụrụ na nnwale ahụ gaa nke ọma, ị ga-enwe ike ịga n'ihu ma mechaa nrụnye ahụ."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Additional Steps After Installation"
msgstr "Nzọụkwụ Ndị Ọzọ Mgbe Nrụnye Gasịrị"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "It is essential that the Central Cacti server can communicate via MySQL to each remote Cacti database server.  Once the install is complete, you must edit the Remote Data Collector and ensure the settings are correct.  You can verify using the 'Test Connection' when editing the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Ọ dị mkpa ka sava isi Cacti nwee ike ịkparịta ụka site na MySQL gaa na sava nchekwa data Cacti nke dị n'ebe dị anya nke ọ bụla. Ozugbo nrụnye ahụ gwụchara, ị ga-edezi Onye Nchịkọta Data Dị N'ebe Dị Anya ma hụ na ntọala ndị ahụ ziri ezi. I nwere ike ịchọpụta site na iji 'Nwalee Njikọ' mgbe ị na-edezi Onye Nchịkọta Data Dị N'ebe Dị Anya."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Critical Binary Locations and Versions"
msgstr "Ebe Faịlụ Baịnarị Dị Mkpa Na Ụdị Ha"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Make sure all of these values are correct before continuing."
msgstr "Hụ na uru ndị a niile ziri ezi tupu ị gaa n'ihu."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "One or more paths appear to be incorrect, unable to proceed"
msgstr "Otu ụzọ ma ọ bụ karịa yiri ka ezighị ezi, enweghị ike ịga n'ihu"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Directory Permission Checks"
msgstr "Nnyocha Ikike Ndekọ"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please ensure the directory permissions below are correct before proceeding.  During the install, these directories need to be owned by the Web Server user.  These permission changes are required to allow the Installer to install Device Template packages which include XML and script files that will be placed in these directories.  If you choose not to install the packages, there is an 'install_package.php' cli script that can be used from the command line after the install is complete."
msgstr "Biko hụ na ikike ndekọ dị n'okpuru ziri ezi tupu ị gaa n'ihu. N'oge nrụnye, ndekọ ndị a kwesịrị ịbụ nke onye ọrụ Sava Weebụ. Mgbanwe ikike ndị a dị mkpa iji mee ka Onye Nrụnye wụnye ngwugwu Ndetu Ngwaọrụ nke gụnyere faịlụ XML na edemede nke a ga-etinye na ndekọ ndị a. Ọ bụrụ na ị họrọ ịghara ịwụnye ngwugwu ndị ahụ, e nwere edemede cli 'install_package.php' nke a ga-eji mee ihe site n'ahịrị iwu mgbe nrụnye ahụ gwụchara."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "After the install is complete, you can make some of these directories read only to increase security."
msgstr "Mgbe nrụnye ahụ gwụchara, ị nwere ike ime ka ụfọdụ n'ime ndekọ ndị a bụrụ naanị ọgụgụ iji mee ka nchekwa sie ike."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "These directories will be required to stay read writable after the install so that the Cacti remote synchronization process can update them as the Main Cacti Web Site changes"
msgstr "Ndekọ ndị a ga-adị mkpa ịnọgide na-enwe ikike ọgụgụ na ndepụta mgbe nrụnye gasịrị ka usoro mmekọrịta nke Cacti dị n'ebe dị anya wee nwee ike imelite ha ka Isi Saịtị Weebụ Cacti na-agbanwe"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If you are installing packages, once the packages are installed, you should change the scripts directory back to read only as this presents some exposure to the web site."
msgstr "Ọ bụrụ na ị na-awụnye ngwugwu, ozugbo e wụnyere ngwugwu ndị ahụ, ị kwesịrị ịgbanwe ndekọ edemede ahụ laghachi na naanị ọgụgụ n'ihi na nke a nwere ike ikpughe saịtị weebụ ahụ n'ihe ize ndụ."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "For remote pollers, it is critical that the paths that you will be updating frequently, including the plugins, scripts, and resources paths have read/write access as the data collector will have to update these paths from the main web server content."
msgstr "Maka ndị nyocha dị n'ebe dị anya, ọ dị oke mkpa ka ụzọ ndị ị ga na-emelite ugboro ugboro, gụnyere ụzọ plugins, scripts, na resources nwee ikike ọgụgụ/ndepụta n'ihi na onye nchịkọta data ga-emelite ụzọ ndị a site na ọdịnaya isi sava weebụ."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Required Writable at Install Time Only"
msgstr "A Chọrọ Ka E Nwee Ike Idepụta Naanị N'oge Nrụnye"

#: lib/installer.php package_import.php
msgid "Not Writable"
msgstr "Enweghị Ike Idepụta"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Required Writable after Install Complete"
msgstr "A Chọrọ Ka E Nwee Ike Idepụta Mgbe Nrụnye Gwụchara"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Potential permission issues"
msgstr "Nsogbu ikike ndị nwere ike ịdị"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please make sure that your webserver has read/write access to the cacti folders that show errors below."
msgstr "Biko hụ na sava weebụ gị nwere ikike ọgụgụ/ndepụta na folda cacti ndị na-egosi mperi n'okpuru."

#: lib/installer.php
