#: utilities.php
msgid "Cacti technical support page.  Used by developers and technical support persons to assist with issues in Cacti.  Includes checks for common configuration issues."
msgstr "Peeji nkwado teknụzụ Cacti. Ndị mmepe na ndị ọrụ nkwado teknụzụ na-eji ya enyere aka n'okwu dị na Cacti. Ọ gụnyere nyocha maka nsogbu nhazi ndị a na-ahụkarị."

#: utilities.php
msgid "The Cacti Log stores statistic, error and other message depending on system settings.  This information can be used to identify problems with the poller and application."
msgstr "Ndekọ Cacti na-echekwa ọnụọgụgụ, njehie na ozi ndị ọzọ dabere na ntọala sistemụ. Enwere ike iji ozi a chọpụta nsogbu dị na poller na ngwa."

#: utilities.php
msgid "Allows Administrators to browse the user log.  Administrators can filter and export the log as well."
msgstr "Na-enye Ndị Nchịkwa ohere ịchọgharị ndekọ onye ọrụ. Ndị Nchịkwa nwekwara ike ịhịọ ma bupụ ndekọ ahụ."

#: utilities.php
msgid "Poller Cache Administration"
msgstr "Nchịkwa Poller Cache"

#: utilities.php
msgid "This is the data that is being passed to the poller each time it runs. This data is then in turn executed/interpreted and the results are fed into the RRDfiles for graphing or the database for display."
msgstr "Nke a bụ data a na-ezigara poller oge ọ bụla ọ na-arụ ọrụ. A na-eme/atụgharị data a n'aka nke ya ma tinye nsonaazụ ya n'ime RRDfiles maka ise eserese ma ọ bụ na nchekwa data maka ngosi."

#: utilities.php
msgid "The Data Query Cache stores information gathered from Data Query input types. The values from these fields can be used in the text area of Graphs for Legends, Vertical Labels, and GPRINTS as well as in CDEF's."
msgstr "Nchekwa Ajụjụ Data na-echekwa ozi anakọtara site n'ụdị ntinye Ajụjụ Data. Enwere ike iji uru sitere na mpaghara ndị a na mpaghara ederede nke Eserese maka Nkọwa Eserese, Akara Kwụ Ọtọ, na GPRINTS nakwa na CDEF's."

#: utilities.php
msgid "Rebuild Poller Cache"
msgstr "Rụgharịa Poller Cache"

#: utilities.php
msgid "The Poller Cache will be re-generated if you select this option. Use this option only in the event of a database crash if you are experiencing issues after the crash and have already run the database repair tools.  Alternatively, if you are having problems with a specific Device, simply re-save that Device to rebuild its Poller Cache.  There is also a command line interface equivalent to this command that is recommended for large systems."
msgstr "A ga-emepụta Poller Cache ọzọ ma ọ bụrụ na ị họrọ nhọrọ a. Jiri nhọrọ a naanị ma ọ bụrụ na nchekwa data adaala ma ị na-enwe nsogbu mgbe ọ dara ma ị rụọla ngwaọrụ nrụzi nchekwa data. N'aka nke ọzọ, ọ bụrụ na ị na-enwe nsogbu na Ngwaọrụ akọwapụtara, naanị chekwaa Ngwaọrụ ahụ ọzọ iji rụgharịa Poller Cache ya. Enwekwara usoro iwu ahịrị nke kwekọrọ n'iwu a nke a na-atụ aro maka sistemụ buru ibu."

#: utilities.php
msgid "NOTE: On large systems, this command may take several minutes to hours to complete and therefore should not be run from the Cacti UI.  You can simply run 'php -q cli/rebuild_poller_cache.php --help' at the command line for more information."
msgstr "NDETU: Na sistemụ buru ibu, iwu a nwere ike iwe ọtụtụ nkeji ruo awa iji mechaa ya mere ekwesịghị ịgba ya site na UI Cacti. Ị nwere ike ịgba 'php -q cli/rebuild_poller_cache.php --help' n'ahịrị iwu maka ozi ndị ọzọ."

#: utilities.php
msgid "Rebuild Resource Cache"
msgstr "Rụgharịa Nchekwa Akụrụngwa"

#: utilities.php
msgid "When operating multiple Data Collectors in Cacti, Cacti will attempt to maintain state for key files on all Data Collectors.  This includes all core, non-install related website and plugin files.  When you force a Resource Cache rebuild, Cacti will clear the local Resource Cache, and then rebuild it at the next scheduled poller start.  This will trigger all Remote Data Collectors to recheck their website and plugin files for consistency."
msgstr "Mgbe ị na-arụ ọtụtụ Ndị Nchịkọta Data na Cacti, Cacti ga-anwa idobe ọnọdụ maka faịlụ ndị dị mkpa na Ndị Nchịkọta Data niile. Nke a gụnyere faịlụ isi niile, faịlụ weebụsaịtị na ngwa mgbakwunye na-abụghị nke nrụnye. Mgbe ị manyere nrụgharị Nchekwa Akụrụngwa, Cacti ga-ekpochapụ Nchekwa Akụrụngwa mpaghara, wee rụgharịa ya na mmalite poller ahaziri ọzọ. Nke a ga-akpalite Ndị Nchịkọta Data Dị Anya niile ka ha lelee faịlụ weebụsaịtị na ngwa mgbakwunye ha ọzọ maka nkwụsi ike."

